<title>SRI LANKA: Lanka Lubricants 3-mth net up 55 pct.</title>
<headline>Lanka Lubricants 3-mth net up 55 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Lanka Lubricants Ltd, for the three months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1997	     1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	    602.59   vs    470.07</p>
<p>    Net profit	   60.59   vs     39.03</p>
<p>    Tax		    34.78   vs     21.58</p>
<p>NOTE - Lanka Lubricants Ltd, a Caltex subsidiary, is the sole manufacturer and distributor of lubricating oils in Sri Lanka.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
